+        // instead" -- measured on the field GSQ server, that window never comes (a prefill precedes every
+        // drop, and the ring is held across the whole prefill), so the floor stayed at the sizing estimate
+        // (1536 instead of 1792/2048), each drop returned less band, and the re-arm had to shrink whole layers
